    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project FD</strong>  is a multiplayer action game that combines dungeon escape survival with high-quality pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as adventurers with different abilities in ancient ruins, fighting monsters, completing quests, finding loot, and escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/de426b463700d87620f35a1d0df50a37.poster.avif?t=1740361995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/de426b463700d87620f35a1d0df50a37.webm?t=1740361995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/de426b463700d87620f35a1d0df50a37.mp4?t=1740361995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 2 players and explore dungeon filled with threats. Of course, it is also possible to venture alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must respond to various situations by combining various characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful and special consumable items to overcome crisis situations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/53bd48eac7f9c23ed8236c6a2a9f107d.poster.avif?t=1740361995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/53bd48eac7f9c23ed8236c6a2a9f107d.webm?t=1740361995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/53bd48eac7f9c23ed8236c6a2a9f107d.mp4?t=1740361995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain weapons that preserve the glory of the past within the dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve the valuables you were asked to search for and escape safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many kinds of dangerous maps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/2c0a77412e22963ca9b4f4595099a458.poster.avif?t=1740361995\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/2c0a77412e22963ca9b4f4595099a458.webm?t=1740361995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/2c0a77412e22963ca9b4f4595099a458.mp4?t=1740361995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various dangers such as monsters, anomalies, and traps. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the various devices remaining in the ruins to help you survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain an arcane seal to get strengthening effects to respond to rapidly changing situations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop various characters with unique occupations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up various equipment to maximize your character\u2019s abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your character\u2019s skill tree according to your desired characteristics\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run an adventurer's guild that attracts special guests from the city where the ruins were discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist adventurers  exploring the dungeon escape safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broker requests from guests looking for items that can only be found in the dungeon and acquire benefits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Project FD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project FD\u00a0</strong>is being developed by a small team that loves a variety of Co-op multiplayer games, dungeon crawlers, and loot shooter genres.\u00a0 If you enjoyed <strong>\u00a0the Diablo series, Strange Dungeon series</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>Darkest Dungeon series</strong>, and Dark and Darker, Project FD will give you with  a unique and new fun experience in the dungeon crawler genre. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project FD</strong>  is a multiplayer action game that combines dungeon escape survival with high-quality pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as adventurers with different abilities in ancient ruins, fighting monsters, completing quests, finding loot, and escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/de426b463700d87620f35a1d0df50a37.poster.avif?t=1740361995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/de426b463700d87620f35a1d0df50a37.webm?t=1740361995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/de426b463700d87620f35a1d0df50a37.mp4?t=1740361995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 2 players and explore dungeon filled with threats. Of course, it is also possible to venture alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must respond to various situations by combining various characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful and special consumable items to overcome crisis situations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/53bd48eac7f9c23ed8236c6a2a9f107d.poster.avif?t=1740361995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/extras/53bd48eac7f9c23ed8236c6a2a9f107d.webm?t=1740361995\" type=\"vid