ree according to your desired characteristics\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run an adventurer's guild that attracts special guests from the city where the ruins were discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist adventurers  exploring the dungeon escape safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broker requests from guests looking for items that can only be found in the dungeon and acquire benefits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Project FD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project FD\u00a0</strong>is being developed by a small team that loves a variety of Co-op multiplayer games, dungeon crawlers, and loot shooter genres.\u00a0 If you enjoyed <strong>\u00a0the Diablo series, Strange Dungeon series</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>Darkest Dungeon series</strong>, and Dark and Darker, Project FD will give you with  a unique and new fun experience in the dungeon crawler genre. </p>",
